%!PS
% SPDX-FileCopyrightText: 2026 EfterScript contributors
% SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
% requires: resident-outlines
% Scenario: Helvetica embedded. With EmbedAllFonts true the Helvetica
% text becomes a TrueType font dictionary whose descriptor embeds a
% subset of the face's outline asset, named by the asset's own name
% with a subset tag and carrying the widths of the metrics; the page's
% text extracts unchanged.
<< /EmbedAllFonts true >> setdistillerparams
/Helvetica findfont 24 scalefont setfont
72 700 moveto (Hi) show
showpage
